===Etymology===
The obsolete sense derives from {{bor|en|la|rhododendron|t=oleander}}, from {{der|en|grc|ῥοδόδενδρον|t=oleander}}, from {{m|grc|ῥόδον||rose}} + {{m|grc|δένδρον||tree}}. The modern sense comes through the intermediary of the genus name {{m|mul|Rhododendron}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|code=165299}}</ref>

